   "created_at": "2026-11-27T08:37:15.507Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/unormal.bsky.social/post/3n3brvtwkds2z",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "Joined the Tech Report to talk about how Jensen Huang’s return to Nvidia has painted a target on the CEO’s back, and how Anthropic’s IPO a week on has failed to reignite enthusiasm in the AI industry - and potentially doomed OpenAI.\nwww.youtube.com/watch?v=eSBT...",
   "handle": "edzitron.com",
   "display_name": "Ed Zitron",
   "likes": 272,
   "reposts": 20,
   "replies": 3,
   "created_at": "2026-11-27T20:19:19.410Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/edzitron.com/post/3n3cz5afzfc2q",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eSBTwCdODpY",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "imagining one million Claude instances all trying to make the boobs of the protagonist bigger and her face younger at the same time",
   "handle": "kthorjensen.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "K. Thor Jensen",
   "likes": 257,
   "reposts": 20,
   "replies": 22,
   "created_at": "2026-11-27T22:27:05.848Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/kthorjensen.bsky.social/post/3n3dabpp77c2g",
