   "external": "",
   "query": "Claude AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "My father is the pettiest motherfucker ever. \n\nClient asked him for a LLM application. Man spent 10k on the hardware for LLMs to prove that it can’t do shit, then made the client pay him DOUBLE for the labor.",
   "handle": "shengokai.blacksky.app",
