   "likes": 210,
   "reposts": 32,
   "replies": 5,
   "created_at": "2026-11-27T09:04:00.417Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/shengokai.blacksky.app/post/3n3btfoiicc2g",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "Oh good another article from Groundbreaker that's near-entirely written by Claude and makes a bunch of assumptions that, while interesting, are genuinely painful to parse! I will also say calling these long-dated leases \"credit swaps\" is nonsense to me\nwww.groundbrkr.com/p/mark-to-sw...",
