   "external": "https://www.groundbrkr.com/p/mark-to-swap-how-the-market-is-mispricing",
   "query": "Claude AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ah, I see the Leonida airport switched to the LLM routing system.",
   "handle": "twentyyearstoolate.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "How Do You Like Them Kobolds?",
   "likes": 253,
   "reposts": 0,
   "replies": 1,
   "created_at": "2026-11-27T03:25:40.567Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/twentyyearstoolate.bsky.social/post/3n3baip2ays2k",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "> new anti-ai article is reposted onto my timeline\n> asks the poster if the article written by a human or an LLM\n> they don't understand\n> pull out illustrated diagram explaining human vs LLM writing\n> they laugh and say \"it's a good article sir\"\n> read the article\n> it's claude",
   "handle": "mattkeeter.com",
   "display_name": "Matt Keeter",
   "likes": 207,
   "reposts": 15,
   "replies": 6,
   "created_at": "2026-11-27T00:51:42.967Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattkeeter.com/post/3n3axvff2bk2r",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Claude AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "I cannot believe @thebookseller.com got a statement from the agent and didn't trouble to ask about them hanging their author out to dry in the press. Like \"why did you leak this to Publisher's Lunch\" would have been a good question for an actual journalist to ask.",
   "handle": "kjcharleswriter.com",
   "display_name": "KJ Charles",
   "likes": 151,
   "reposts": 31,
   "replies": 6,
   "created_at": "2026-11-27T09:32:20.878Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/kjcharleswriter.com/post/3n3buye6knc2j",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.thebookseller.com/news/author-denies-allegations-she-used-ai-to-write-book-after-novel-dropped-by-agent",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "By the end of this piece you will know what the evidence shows, what the law demands, and the questions I would put to Nvidia under oath.\nwww.uncensoredobjection.com/p/nvidia-ai-...",
   "handle": "conifergirl.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "conifergirl.bsky.social",
   "likes": 107,
   "reposts": 47,
   "replies": 4,
   "created_at": "2026-11-27T17:07:43.939Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/conifergirl.bsky.social/post/3n3cognibez2f",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.uncensoredobjection.com/p/nvidia-ai-computers-keep-turning?utm_source=post-email-title&publication_id=4115828&post_id=226789871&utm_campaign=email-post-title&isFreemail=true&r=6eh1eo&triedRedirect=true&utm_medium=email",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Correct. And this is also what's happening to all tech in Silicon Valley because of the AI driven layoffs. They're firing experts and keeping mid-salaried mid-coders armed with Claude. Lol. Don't expect shit to get better anytime soon.",
   "handle": "coachfinstock.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Coach Finstock",
   "likes": 127,
   "reposts": 28,
   "replies": 2,
   "created_at": "2026-11-26T21:22:16.061Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/coachfinstock.bsky.social/post/3n3am6unl3k2y",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Claude AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "I think LLM writing tends to be very bad and continues to get worse:\n\n* no sense of linear sequencing\n* no sense of rhythm, negative space, catching a breath\n* no forbearance; all special moves, no punches and kicks, as my partner puts it\n\nWrite well, and the resulting text is very obviously not LLM",
   "handle": "sunshowers.io",
   "display_name": "rain 🌦️",
   "likes": 144,
   "reposts": 13,
   "replies": 1,
   "created_at": "2026-11-27T19:34:53.715Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/sunshowers.io/post/3n3cwns7ils2y",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "You'd think that after all the GPT 4o issues, LLM devs would know that they should aggressively avoid these types of parasocial interactions.\n\nBut hey, it's Facebook, I guess I shouldn't be surprised that they value engagement and retention above the mental health of their users.",
